## File Structure

```
bs-upgrade/
├── index.html          ← Main public website
├── styles.css          ← All design styles (colours, fonts, layout)
├── data.js             ← All store data (products, prices, testimonials, quiz)
├── admin.html          ← Admin dashboard (order management)
├── admin.css           ← Admin dashboard styles
├── supabase-setup.js   ← Supabase client — put your keys here
├── supabase-schema.sql ← Run once in Supabase SQL Editor to create tables
└── README.md           ← This file
```

Your product photos (e.g. `1001017209.jpg`) go in the same folder.

