## Quick Start

### 1. Deploy to Vercel

1. Go to [vercel.com](https://vercel.com) → New Project → Upload
2. Drag the entire `bs-upgrade` folder
3. Click Deploy — your site is live in under a minute
4. Go to Settings → Domains to connect `baddiestrands.com`

### 2. Set Up Supabase (database)

1. Go to [supabase.com](https://supabase.com) → New Project
2. Name it `baddie-strands`, set a strong password, choose a region
3. Wait ~2 minutes for it to spin up
4. Go to **SQL Editor → New Query**, paste `supabase-schema.sql`, click **Run**
5. Go to **Project Settings → API**, copy:
   - Project URL
   - anon / public key
6. Open `supabase-setup.js` and replace the two placeholder values

### 3. Add Paystack Key

1. Log into [paystack.com](https://paystack.com) → Settings → API Keys
2. Copy your Live Public Key (starts with `pk_live_`)
3. Open `index.html`, find `BS_CONFIG` near the bottom, replace `'pk_live_YOUR_PAYSTACK_PUBLIC_KEY'`

### 4. Add Access Bank Account Number

In `index.html` inside `BS_CONFIG`, replace `'0000000000'` with your real account number.

### 5. Redeploy

After editing any file, go back to Vercel → Deployments → Redeploy (or just re-upload the folder).

