## How Orders Work

1. Customer browses → adds to bag → clicks Checkout
2. If not signed in → prompted to sign in via email OTP
3. Fills in delivery details (name, phone, address, all 36 states + FCT)
4. Chooses payment: **Card via Paystack** or **Bank Transfer via Access Bank**
5. Order is saved to Supabase → visible in your admin dashboard
6. You receive a notification at baddiestrands@gmail.com (configure in Supabase → Auth → Email)

