## Updating Products

Open `data.js` and edit the `products` array. Each product has:

| Field | What it does |
|---|---|
| `id` | Unique number — never reuse a deleted ID |
| `name` | Product name shown on the card and modal |
| `category` | `"wigs"`, `"bundles"`, or `"extensions"` — controls the filter tabs |
| `price` | Price in Naira (number, no commas) |
| `oldPrice` | Sale price shown crossed out — set to `null` if no sale |
| `hot: true` | Shows the **Bestseller** badge |
| `new: true` | Shows the **New In** badge |
| `image` | Filename of your photo (e.g. `"my-wig.jpg"`) or a full URL |
| `lengths` | Array of available lengths shown in the product modal |
| `colors` | Hex codes for the colour swatches |

