## Enabling Google & Apple Sign-In

Both are wired in the code already. To activate:

**Google:**
1. Supabase → Authentication → Providers → Google → Enable
2. Go to [console.cloud.google.com](https://console.cloud.google.com) → Create OAuth 2.0 credentials
3. Add your Vercel URL as an authorised redirect URI
4. Paste the Client ID and Secret into Supabase

**Apple:**
1. Requires an Apple Developer account ($99/year)
2. Supabase → Authentication → Providers → Apple → follow the instructions

