## Updating the Hero Image

The hero uses `1001017209.jpg` — your real product photo. Just make sure that file is in the `bs-upgrade` folder when you upload to Vercel. To change it, open `index.html` and find:

```html
<div class="hero-bg" style="background-image:url('1001017209.jpg')"></div>
```

Replace the filename with your new image.

